---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = 'Chinmaya Jnanashakti - Sri Dandayudhapani';
const description = 'Support the sacred installation of Sri Jnana Dandayudhapani at Chinmaya Mission San Antonio. Build His home. The Staff of Wisdom. The Anchor of our Lives.';
---

<Layout {title} {description}>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="relative h-screen flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
    <!-- Background Image -->
    <div
      class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat"
      style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1545056854-41a855fc8c64?w=1600&h=900&fit=crop');"
    ></div>

    <!-- Dark Gradient Overlay -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-maroon-900/80 via-burgundy-900/70 to-maroon-900/80"></div>

    <!-- Hero Content -->
    <div class="relative z-10 text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <!-- Decorative Top Element -->
      <div class="mb-6 flex justify-center">
        <div class="h-1 w-20 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#8B2F39] to-[#6B2027] rounded-full"></div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Title -->
      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-serif font-bold text-white mb-6 leading-tight tracking-wide">
        Jnanashakti
      </h1>

      <!-- Mission Statement -->
      <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl lg:text-3xl text-maroon-100 font-light mb-8 italic leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        The Staff of Wisdom. The Anchor of our Lives.
      </p>

      <!-- Subtitle -->
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-maroon-100 mb-12 font-light max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Support the sacred installation of Sri Jnana Dandayudhapani
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Scroll Down Indicator -->
    <div class="mt-16 flex justify-center">
      <div class="animate-bounce">
        <svg
          class="w-6 h-6 text-[#8B2F39]"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          stroke-width="2"
        >
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 14l-7 7m0 0l-7-7m7 7V3"></path>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Decorative Bottom Curve -->
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-32 bg-gradient-to-t from-white to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>
  </section>

  <style>
    section {
      animation: fadeIn 0.8s ease-in;
    }

    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
      }
    }
  </style>

  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <!-- The Story -->
    <section class="mb-20">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-burgundy-900 mb-8 text-center">
        The Lord is Waiting
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-maroon-800 mb-8 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        For years, our community has flourished under the guidance of Vedantic wisdom. Yet, a home is incomplete without its presiding deity—the source of Shakti that fuels our spiritual journey.
      </p>

      <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-burgundy-50 to-burgundy-50 p-12 rounded-lg border-2 border-burgundy-300">
        <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-burgundy-900 mb-6 text-center">
            Sri Jnana Dandayudhapani Comes Home
          </h3>
          <p class="text-maroon-800 mb-6">
            <strong>Sri Jnana Dandayudhapani</strong> represents two fundamental powers:
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-4 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-maroon-50 p-4 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-burgundy-600">
              <span class="text-2xl flex-shrink-0">📚</span>
              <div>
                <p class="font-serif font-bold text-burgundy-900 mb-1">Jnana - The Power of Knowledge</p>
                <p class="text-maroon-800">Wisdom that illuminates the path of spiritual understanding and enlightenment.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-maroon-50 p-4 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-burgundy-600">
              <span class="text-2xl flex-shrink-0">💪</span>
              <div>
                <p class="font-serif font-bold text-burgundy-900 mb-1">Danda - The Strength of Discipline</p>
                <p class="text-maroon-800">The determination and commitment to walk the righteous path with unwavering resolve.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
          </ul>

          <div class="bg-burgundy-100 border-2 border-burgundy-400 p-8 rounded-lg text-center">
            <p class="text-2xl font-serif italic text-burgundy-900 mb-4">
              "His home is being built. His pedestal is being prepared. Your hands will make it possible."
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- The Significance -->
    <section class="mb-20">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-burgundy-900 mb-12 text-center">
        The Sacred Installation (Murti Sthaapana)
      </h2>
      
      <p class="text-lg text-maroon-800 mb-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
        The installation of Sri Dandayudhapani is not simply placing a statue in our temple. It represents the anchoring of our spiritual hearts. It marks the completion of a vision—a sacred presence that will guide, protect, and inspire our community for generations to come.
      </p>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-burgundy-50 to-maroon-50 p-8 rounded-lg border-2 border-burgundy-300">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-burgundy-900 mb-4 flex items-center">
            <span class="text-3xl mr-3">🏛️</span>
            Spiritual Anchor
          </h3>
          <p class="text-maroon-800">
            A permanent home for Sri Dandayudhapani at our temple, establishing a focal point of devotion and wisdom for spiritual seekers.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-burgundy-50 to-burgundy-50 p-8 rounded-lg border-2 border-burgundy-300">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-burgundy-900 mb-4 flex items-center">
            <span class="text-3xl mr-3">🙏</span>
            Community Unity
          </h3>
          <p class="text-maroon-800">
            Your participation in this sacred project unites the community in a collective act of devotion and service to the divine.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-maroon-50 to-burgundy-50 p-8 rounded-lg border-2 border-maroon-300">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-burgundy-900 mb-4 flex items-center">
            <span class="text-3xl mr-3">✨</span>
            Divine Presence
          </h3>
          <p class="text-maroon-800">
            The sacred energy of knowledge and discipline will bless our temple, our families, and all who seek refuge in spiritual wisdom.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-maroon-50 to-burgundy-50 p-8 rounded-lg border-2 border-maroon-300">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-maroon-900 mb-4 flex items-center">
            <span class="text-3xl mr-3">🌟</span>
            Legacy for Future
          </h3>
          <p class="text-maroon-800">
            A living testament to our commitment that will serve as inspiration and spiritual strength for generations to come.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Sponsorship Tiers -->
    <section class="mb-20">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-burgundy-900 mb-8 text-center">
        Be a Pillar of Support
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-maroon-800 text-center mb-12 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        "We are building a home for the One who holds us up." Every contribution, at any level, is sacred and essential to completing this divine project. Choose your role in this historic installation.
      </p>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-8">
        <!-- Grand Patron -->
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#481719] to-[#481719] text-white p-8 rounded-lg shadow-lg border-2 border-[#74272b] transform hover:scale-105 transition">
          <div class="mb-4">
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest">GRAND PATRON</p>
            <p class="text-4xl font-bold my-2">$25,000+</p>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[#f5f1ef] mb-6 pb-6 border-b border-[#e1d5cf]">
            The Foundation Bearer
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-[#e0c3ba] mt-1">✓</span>
              <span class="text-sm">Permanent recognition on Donor Wall</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-[#e0c3ba] mt-1">✓</span>
              <span class="text-sm">Special role in Sthaapana Ceremony</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-[#e0c3ba] mt-1">✓</span>
              <span class="text-sm">Family Archana during installation</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-[#e0c3ba] mt-1">✓</span>
              <span class="text-sm">Lifetime gratitude and blessings</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <a 
            href="https://secure.givelively.org/donate/chinmaya-mission-san-antonio-cmsa/chinmaya-jnanashakti"
            target="_blank"
            class="w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-[#d5afa3] text-[#481719] hover:bg-[#c9a391] font-serif font-bold py-2 px-4 rounded transition"
          >
            Sponsor Now
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Danda Patron -->
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#74272b] to-[#6B2027] text-white p-8 rounded-lg shadow-lg border-2 border-[#A0373D] transform hover:scale-105 transition">
          <div class="mb-4">
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest">THE DANDA PATRON</p>
            <p class="text-4xl font-bold my-2">$10,000+</p>
          </div>
          <p class="text-burgundy-100 mb-6 pb-6 border-b border-burgundy-300">
            The Strength of the Mission
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-burgundy-200 mt-1">✓</span>
              <span class="text-sm">Permanent recognition on Donor Wall</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-burgundy-200 mt-1">✓</span>
              <span class="text-sm">Special role in Sthaapana Ceremony</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-burgundy-200 mt-1">✓</span>
              <span class="text-sm">Family Archana during installation</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <a 
            href="https://secure.givelively.org/donate/chinmaya-mission-san-antonio-cmsa/chinmaya-jnanashakti"
            target="_blank"
            class="w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-[#faf8f7] text-[#74272b] hover:bg-[#ebe3df] font-serif font-bold py-2 px-4 rounded transition"
          >
            Sponsor Now
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Mayura Sponsor -->
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#A0373D] to-[#A0373D] text-white p-8 rounded-lg shadow-lg border-2 border-[#d7c7bf] transform hover:scale-105 transition">
          <div class="mb-4">
            <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest">VEHICLE OF GRACE</p>
            <p class="text-4xl font-bold my-2">$5,000</p>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[#f5f1ef] mb-6 pb-6 border-b border-[#e1d5cf]">
            Rituals & Adornments
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-[#ebe3df] mt-1">✓</span>
              <span class="text-sm">Recognition on Donor Wall</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-[#ebe3df] mt-1">✓</span>
              <span class="text-sm">Funds the Installation Rituals</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-[#ebe3df] mt-1">✓</span>
              <span class="text-sm">Invitation to special events</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <a 
            href="https://secure.givelively.org/donate/chinmaya-mission-san-antonio-cmsa/chinmaya-jnanashakti"
            target="_blank"
            class="w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-[#faf8f7] text-[#74272b] hover:bg-[#ebe3df] font-serif font-bold py-2 px-4 rounded transition"
          >
            Sponsor Now
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Additional Sponsorship Levels -->
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <!-- Sannidhi Sponsor -->
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#f5ebe8] to-[#ebe3df] p-6 rounded-lg border-2 border-[#ead7d1] text-center">
          <h4 class="text-lg font-serif font-bold text-[#481719] mb-2">Sannidhi Sponsor</h4>
          <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#5e1f22] mb-3">$2,500</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#5e1f22] mb-4">Sanctum Setup</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-[#4d1217] mb-6">
            <li>✓ Invitation to special events</li>
            <li>✓ Prepares the Sacred Pedestal</li>
          </ul>
          <a 
            href="https://secure.givelively.org/donate/chinmaya-mission-san-antonio-cmsa/chinmaya-jnanashakti"
            target="_blank"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-[#8a2f34] text-white hover:bg-[#74272b] font-semibold py-2 px-6 rounded transition"
          >
            Sponsor Now
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Shakti Sponsor -->
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#f5ebe8] to-[#ebe3df] p-6 rounded-lg border-2 border-[#ead7d1] text-center">
          <h4 class="text-lg font-serif font-bold text-[#4d1217] mb-2">Shakti Sponsor</h4>
          <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#5c1a1f] mb-3">$1,008</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#5c1a1f] mb-4">Support the Puja Rituals</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-[#4d1217] mb-6">
            <li>✓ Sacred acknowledgment</li>
            <li>✓ Blessing in rituals</li>
          </ul>
          <a 
            href="https://secure.givelively.org/donate/chinmaya-mission-san-antonio-cmsa/chinmaya-jnanashakti"
            target="_blank"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-[#6B2027] text-white hover:bg-[#5c1a1f] font-semibold py-2 px-6 rounded transition"
          >
            Sponsor Now
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Bhakti Brick -->
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#ebe3df] to-[#f5ebe8] p-6 rounded-lg border-2 border-[#e1d5cf] text-center">
          <h4 class="text-lg font-serif font-bold text-[#481719] mb-2">Bhakti Brick</h4>
          <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#5e1f22] mb-3">$108</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#5e1f22] mb-4">A Brick in the Foundation</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-[#4d1217] mb-6">
            <li>✓ For all ages</li>
            <li>✓ Part of sacred legacy</li>
          </ul>
          <a 
            href="https://secure.givelively.org/donate/chinmaya-mission-san-antonio-cmsa/chinmaya-jnanashakti"
            target="_blank"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-[#8a2f34] text-white hover:bg-[#74272b] font-semibold py-2 px-6 rounded transition"
          >
            Sponsor Now
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Vision & Impact -->
    <section class="mb-20 bg-gradient-to-r from-burgundy-50 to-burgundy-50 p-12 rounded-lg border-2 border-burgundy-300">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-burgundy-900 mb-6 text-center">
        Building His Home
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-maroon-800 mb-6 text-center">
        Your support directly contributes to the sacred installation of Sri Jnana Dandayudhapani. Together, we are creating a spiritual beacon that will serve our community for generations, inspiring seekers to pursue wisdom, discipline, and righteous living.
      </p>
      <p class="text-center text-burgundy-900 font-serif italic text-xl">
        Every contribution is sacred. Every sponsor is essential.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Final CTA -->
    <section class="bg-gradient-to-r from-burgundy-600 to-burgundy-600 text-white rounded-lg p-12 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-serif font-bold mb-4">Open Your Heart</h2>
      <p class="text-lg mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Join us in this sacred mission to welcome Sri Jnana Dandayudhapani to His permanent home. Your generosity is an offering of love and devotion.
      </p>
      <a 
        href="https://secure.givelively.org/donate/chinmaya-mission-san-antonio-cmsa/chinmaya-jnanashakti"
        target="_blank"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-maroon-50 text-burgundy-700 hover:bg-burgundy-50 font-serif font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg transition shadow-lg"
      >
        Build His Home
      </a>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
